WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.705
Russia has hit

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.539
Ukraine with a

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.774
new wave of attacks,

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.609
including numerous drone attacks

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.678
launched from the north overnight

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.380
and within the past few minutes.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:13.980
The Ukrainian

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.749
prosecutor's office issued a statement

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:16.449
saying that the

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.884
southern cities of Aparicio

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:18.218
was hit

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.253
by half a dozen missiles

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.355
This is video of the moment.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.656
One of those missiles

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.892
struck a residential building there.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.360
City officials

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.329
say the strike killed one person

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.032
and wounded at least 25 others,

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.900
including children.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.668
Terrifying moments as residents

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.972
tried to grasp exactly what was happening

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:55.488
We'll CNN's

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.157
Ivan Watson filed this report

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:57.791
a little earlier

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:00.193
from Kharkiv in northeast Ukraine.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.696
Ukrainian authorities say at least

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.431
two Russian

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:07.267
missiles slammed into apartment buildings

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.235
in the southern Ukrainian city

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.503
of Zappa, Russia.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.638
This attack

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:15.075
taking place on a on a bright, sunlit day

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.509
in late winter,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.212
which is kind of deceptively beautiful

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.180
when you consider

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.816
the deadly hazards of the conflict

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.050
that are taking place now.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.685
Now, the search and rescue teams

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:26.753
were on the scene.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.456
These were 29 story apartment buildings.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:29.889
The acting

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.291
mayor of the city says at least

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.393
one person has been killed.

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:36.129
Dozens of people hospitalized.

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.264
Fire department on the scene

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:39.732
trying to put out the fires.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.601
At least two children

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.570
injured in this attack

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.838
that has been condemned

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:46.639
by the Ukrainian authorities

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.742
as a war crime, as they put it, committed

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.846
by vile Russian terrorists.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.515
This attack taking place

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.951
the day after the Russian

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.352
and Chinese leaders,

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.488
Vladimir Putin and Xi Jinping

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.556
were embracing each other in Moscow

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.191
after two days of meetings

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.526
where they declared

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:07.127
to the world

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.963
that they want to create a more just more

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:12.165
democratic multipolar

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.067
international order.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.736
Within hours of those declarations and

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.806
the deep declarations of friendship

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.274
between these two leaders,

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.742
the Ukrainian authorities say

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.444
the Russian military fired

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:27.213
multiple deadly missiles and drones

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:30.016
at different Ukrainian cities and towns.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.286
Missiles fired by Russian warplanes

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.622
at the southern port city of Odessa,

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.390
where air defenses succeeded in

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:37.957
knocking down

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.826
at least two of those missiles.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.528
But more got through,

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.163
causing damage to a three storey

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.731
building, wounding people.

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.632
And then the Ukrainian

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:46.266
Air Force, say,

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.867
from the north of Ukraine.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:48.301
At least

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:51.271
21 of these Iranian made Shaheed

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:53.840
drones were fired at Ukraine

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.542
that some 16

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.544
were knocked down by air defenses.

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:59.312
But at least four people were killed

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.381
in a city outside of Kiev.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:04.317
In the town of Tomah in that region.

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:05.785
Several of those drones

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.053
were knocked down.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:07.754
The Russians

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:08.221
say that

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.856
there were some kind of drone attacks

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.658
on the Russian occupied city

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:15.094
of Sevastopol in the Crimean Peninsula.

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.598
All of this air war, which kills

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:21.568
and maims civilians, innocent civilians,

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:22.869
is taking place

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.404
as the two militaries

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:26.339
continue bludgeoning each other,

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:27.807
killing each other in trench

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.475
and artillery warfare

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:31.377
on the very long front lines.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:33.413
Ivan Watson, CNN, Kharkiv.

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:36.616
Well, Ukraine's president posted

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.618
about these separate attacks today,

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:40.687
saying that Russia is shelling the city

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.755
with bestial savagery.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:45.892
Zelensky also making a surprise visit

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.493
to the Donetsk region

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:49.362
where he met troops on the front lines

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:50.597
not far from

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:52.232
the location of the longest

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.700
and deadliest battle

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.369
of this nearly 13 month long war.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.304
He talked to them outside it

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:01.441
inside a warehouse and handed out awards

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:03.309
Well, President Zelensky

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.245
also visited wounded soldiers

00:04:05.245 --> 00:04:06.145
at a hospital,

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:07.080
giving them awards

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.082
and honoring them for their service.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.317
The International Monetary

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:12.452
Fund has announced

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:13.586
it has reached an agreement

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.821
to supply Ukraine

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:16.022
with a financial loan

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:19.292
package of $15.6 billion.

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:21.861
The IMF says the package aims to support

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:24.464
Ukraine's recovery as Russia's invasion,

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:25.798
quote, continues

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:27.967
to have a devastating impact

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:29.068
on the economy.

